        "story": {
          "success": {
            "en": "“आगत्य,” you say, and the folded spirit opens one more fold, as if a page had been turned. “Having come,” he says, reading it. “And so he is here, and the sentence goes on.” He seems taller, and the writing in his folds is a little darker.",
